Cartesian & $G\oblong H$ & $or$\\ & & $u_a\sim u_b\ \wedge\ v_a=v_b$\\
\hline
Direct & $G\times H$ & $u_a\sim u_b\ \wedge\ v_a\sim v_b$\\
\hline
