The medium reference scan examines about 4.7 million labels on the seed-7 instance and performs about 80 million exact operations, taking roughly 13 seconds in isolation. The full gate run repeats that measurement over eight independent seeds, so this is the expected long portion; the answer remains six integers and all non-reference checks are lightweight.
