In the following subsections, we formally define and analyse analogous properties concerning b-homomorphisms and Type II homomorphisms.
%As we will see later in the text, the products of complete graphs tell us important informations about the existence of the investigated colorings of products of graphs. Thus, we start by analysing the structure of these products. 

